# Dragon Magazine Compendium - features of those substitution levels (subst_build.py).


###Block: Changeling Egoist substitution levels
Changeling Egoist	KEY:Changeling Egoist ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.458	DESC:Changeling egoists, naturally inclined to reshape their bodies. Requirements: a changeling egoist about to take the 1st, 3rd or 5th psion level. Class skills: the egoist's plus Bluff and Disguise.
Body Control	KEY:Changeling Egoist ~ Body Control	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Psion Feat|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.458	DESC:Whenever he manifests a psychometabolism power that targets only himself, his manifester level counts as one higher. Replaces the egoist bonus feat gained at 1st level (applied).
Everchanging Psicrystal	KEY:Changeling Egoist ~ Everchanging Psicrystal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	BONUS:SPELLKNOWN|CLASS=Psion;LEVEL=1|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.458	DESC:As a full-round action he selects a new personality for his psicrystal, gaining its benefit and losing the previous one (no effect until he has a psicrystal). Replaces one power known gained at 3rd level: from now on one fewer power known than the psion table shows (applied to 1st-level powers known - move it to another level by hand if preferred).
Extra Powers Known	KEY:Changeling Egoist ~ Extra Powers Known	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Psion Feat|-1	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Psion=1|Thicken Skin	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Psion=2|Chameleon	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Psion=3|Hustle	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Psion=4|Metamorphosis	SOURCEPAGE:p.458	DESC:Chameleon, hustle, metamorphosis and thicken skin are added to his powers known, not counting against his limit (applied); metamorphosis even though it exceeds his maximum power level (known but not yet manifestable). Replaces the egoist bonus feat gained at 5th level (applied).

###Block: Kalashtar Telepath substitution levels
Kalashtar Telepath	KEY:Kalashtar Telepath ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.460	DESC:Kalashtar telepaths, whose dual nature shapes their psionics. Requirements: a kalashtar telepath about to take the 1st, 3rd or 5th psion level. Class skills: the telepath's plus Intimidate.
Telepathic Talent	KEY:Kalashtar Telepath ~ Telepathic Talent	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Psion Feat|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.460	DESC:Whenever he manifests a power of the telepathy discipline (only powers of that discipline), his manifester level counts as one higher. Mindlink: with any kalashtar telepath substitution level he manifests his racial mindlink as a wilder of his Hit Dice (not half), one additional time per day per kalashtar telepath substitution level taken (up to four per day; by hand). Replaces the telepath bonus feat gained at 1st level (applied).
Compound Psicrystal	KEY:Kalashtar Telepath ~ Compound Psicrystal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	BONUS:SPELLKNOWN|CLASS=Psion;LEVEL=1|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.460	DESC:His psicrystal has two different personalities and he gains both benefits (Sage twice with different Knowledge skills). Replaces one power known gained at 3rd level: from now on one fewer power known than the psion table shows (applied to 1st-level powers known - move it by hand if preferred).
Extra Powers Known (Telepathy)	KEY:Kalashtar Telepath ~ Extra Powers Known (Telepathy)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Psion Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Psion Feat|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.460	DESC:He adds any two telepathy discipline powers of 3rd level or lower to his powers known, not counting against his limit (add them by hand). Replaces the telepath bonus feat gained at 5th level (applied).

###Block: Kalashtar Soulknife substitution levels
Kalashtar Soulknife	KEY:Kalashtar Soulknife ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.590	DESC:Kalashtar soulknives, champions of the light. Requirements: a good-aligned kalashtar about to take the 1st, 3rd or 6th soulknife level.
Align Mind Blade	KEY:Kalashtar Soulknife ~ Align Mind Blade	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.590	DESC:He spends 1 power point as a free action to make his mind blade good-aligned for overcoming damage reduction for 1 round; from 10th level he can apply the holy special ability to it. Replaces the free Wild Talent feat (kalashtar gain power points anyway). A kalashtar soulknife who ceases to be good or commits an evil act loses his kalashtar soulknife abilities (by hand).
Purifying Strike	KEY:Kalashtar Soulknife ~ Purifying Strike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	ABILITY:Soulknife Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Soulknife ~ Psychic Strike|PRECLASS:1,Soulknife=7	SOURCEPAGE:p.590	DESC:After a successful touch attack he spends 3 power points to make a dispel check (soulknife level as caster level) against every mind-affecting spell or ability influencing the target; it also counts as dismissal against a quori spirit possessing the target (DC %1 = 10 + soulknife level + Charisma modifier - the target's HD). Replaces psychic strike, which he gains at 7th level instead (applied), its extra damage 1d8 lower than the table (by hand).|10+SoulknifeLVL+CHA
Stand Fast	KEY:Kalashtar Soulknife ~ Stand Fast	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.590	DESC:A +2 dodge bonus to AC in any round in which he moves no more than 5 feet, while psionically focused. Replaces the Speed of Thought bonus feat.

###Block: Shadow Soulknife substitution levels
Shadow Soulknife	KEY:Shadow Soulknife ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.591	DESC:Umbragen soulknives of blade and bow. Requirements: an umbragen about to take the 1st, 6th or 9th soulknife level. Class skills: the soulknife's plus Knowledge (dungeoneering) and Survival, Knowledge (psionics) no longer a class skill (by hand).
Stealthy (Shadow Soulknife)	KEY:Shadow Soulknife ~ Stealthy (Shadow Soulknife)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	ABILITY:FEAT|AUTOMATIC|Stealthy	SOURCEPAGE:p.591	DESC:Stealthy as a bonus feat (applied) - a minor cloak of clinging shadows drawn from the Umbra. Replaces the free Wild Talent feat.
Shadow Bow	KEY:Shadow Soulknife ~ Shadow Bow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.591	DESC:As a full-round action he reshapes his mind blade into a shortbow (1d6, 60 ft. range increment) with its enhancement and abilities, forming at most two arrows of umbral energy per round; no psychic strike through it, no Strength bonus to damage, mind blade weapon feats do not apply. Replaces the Speed of Thought bonus feat.
Improved Shadow Bow	KEY:Shadow Soulknife ~ Improved Shadow Bow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulknife Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.591	DESC:The shadow bow can be a composite shortbow (1d6, 70 ft.) or composite longbow (1d8, 110 ft.) matched to his Strength (Strength bonus to damage), up to three arrows per full attack, and psychic strike with a ranged attack at one die less; not with knife to the soul. Replaces bladewind.

###Block: Shifter Wilder substitution levels
Shifter Wilder	KEY:Shifter Wilder ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Wilder Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.652	DESC:Shifter wilders melding shifting and psionic passion. Requirements: a shifter about to take the 1st, 2nd or 6th wilder level. Class skills: the wilder's plus Survival.
Wild Psychometabolism	KEY:Shifter Wilder ~ Wild Psychometabolism	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Wilder Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.652	DESC:He can learn powers from the egoist list as if they were on the wilder list (by hand).
Savage Renewal	KEY:Shifter Wilder ~ Savage Renewal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Wilder Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.652	DESC:When his shifting ends he regains power points equal to the maximum power level he can know (%1 now; 1 at 2nd level, 9 at 20th). Replaces elude touch.|max(1,min(9,floor((var("CL=Wilder")+1)/2)))
Euphoric Shifting	KEY:Shifter Wilder ~ Euphoric Shifting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Wilder Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.652	DESC:Any round he spends under surging euphoria while shifting does not count against the duration of that shifting (no effect when not shifting).
